@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_28_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:——第四天早晨。|#0201Adv11_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我坐起身，<br>轻盈地从双层床上跳下来。|#0201Adv11_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我看到艾玛<br>也已经坐起身来。|#0201Adv11_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你该不会……一夜没睡吧？|#0201Adv11_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希罗，早上好……<br>其实我睡了一会，但还是担心玛格，<br>很快就醒了……|#0201Adv11_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不用担心玛格。<br>昨天我也去医务室探望了几次，<br>她已经完全恢复精神了。|#0201Adv11_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗！？太好了～～|#0201Adv11_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，给你添麻烦了，对不起……|#0201Adv11_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……虽然你们也有部分责任，<br>但这是看守干的。|#0201Adv11_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:今天是怎么了？总觉得希罗和平常有点不一样。|#0201Adv11_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

; ＠備考◆カッとしかかる

[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0201Adv11_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的说法让我感到恼火，我冷冷地瞪了她一眼。|#0201Adv11_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和平常不一样？<br>你对我了解多少？|#0201Adv11_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……对不起。|#0201Adv11_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（只会道歉也让人火大。<br>　向我道歉有什么用？<br>　艾玛对【她】做过的事已经无法挽回了——）|#0201Adv11_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:感觉再和艾玛交谈下去，<br>可能又会控制不住情绪，<br>于是我急忙朝门口走去。|#0201Adv11_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希罗等等！|#0201Adv11_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么事？我已经没有什么要和你说……|#0201Adv11_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛有些尴尬地<br>向我递出笔记本和钢笔。|#0201Adv11_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:这是你忘的东西吧。你一直随身带着的。|#0201Adv11_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

; ＠備考◆カッとして

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0201Adv11_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; バッと物を奪い取る音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_115 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我几乎是抢夺般从艾玛手中拿过东西。<br>我感到自己的烦躁情绪在加剧，这不是好兆头。|#0201Adv11_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这个环境果然让人压力很大）|#0201Adv11_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这几天，我算是把魔女化导致的冲动<br>抑制下来了。|#0201Adv11_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:保持这个势头的话，我应该不会堕为魔女，<br>但面对这种无计可施的状况，我还是越来越焦躁。|#0201Adv11_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不知道自己什么时候又会像之前一样失控。<br>　明明我不应该再积攒压力）|#0201Adv11_Hiro010|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（都是艾玛在这里害的……！）|#0201Adv11_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我半是迁怒地瞪着艾玛，<br>然后突然想到了什么。|#0201Adv11_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……说起来，你的魔法是什么？|#0201Adv11_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？我的魔法？|#0201Adv11_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:也、也是啊。大家都有神奇的力量……<br>那一定就是所谓魔女的魔法吧。|#0201Adv11_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是我却没有任何神奇的力量。<br>说不定是弄错了什么才把我关进这里的。|#0201Adv11_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……不可能搞错。<br>　是她自己都没有察觉，还是在隐瞒？）|#0201Adv11_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我转过脸不看艾玛，<br>注视着手中的钢笔。|#0201Adv11_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（艾玛是危险的）|#0201Adv11_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
