; 牢の扉が開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_119 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:2_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.99 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:走到地下过道时，<br>诺亚已经在那里埋伏我了。|#0201Adv11_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你是不是，忘记约定了？|#0201Adv11_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被她埋怨的眼神盯着，<br>我脸颊冒汗。|#0201Adv11_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说起来，我确实答应过<br>　要帮诺亚找画画的地方）|#0201Adv11_Hiro015|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……我没忘。只是因为玛格的事有点忙。<br>来，我们先去吃早餐吧。约定的事之后再说。|#0201Adv11_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了！|#0201Adv11_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:（虽然感觉行动会受到很多限制，但也没办法……）|#0201Adv11_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我决定和诺亚一起<br>探索这座监牢。|#0201Adv11_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

